{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"苏格拉底·controversies-and-appraisal","stage":"DONE","category":"socrates","categoryLabel":"苏格拉底","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/20_socrates/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<p>苏格拉底（约公元前470年—前399年）不著一字，其形象全由他人之笔塑成、且彼此矛盾。本部分&quot;争议与评价&quot;是苏格拉底主题六个姊妹 hub 的<strong>批判与综合终点</strong>——它不再叙述史实或讲解思想，而是追问：哪些是史实、哪些是后人建构？这场审判是冤案还是有理？他对民主是友是敌？&quot;西方哲学之父&quot;的称号成立在哪？最终如何给出一个辩证而非神化的全面评判？</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位-讲-评判与辨析-不讲-史实-或-思想\">本 hub 的定位：讲&quot;评判与辨析&quot;，不讲&quot;史实&quot;或&quot;思想&quot;</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁?经历了什么?</td>\n<td>本 hub 校准其&quot;事实&quot;边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>根本贡献是什么?</td>\n<td>本 hub 评价其贡献的成色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>自知无知、诘问法是什么?</td>\n<td>本 hub 引用，不重复展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要著作</a></td>\n<td>他不写作,如何得知其思想?</td>\n<td>提供本 hub 史料批判的对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他如何塑造后世?</td>\n<td>本 hub 评价其地位的依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>6 争议与评价（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>哪些是史实、哪些是建构?如何公允评判?</td>\n<td>其余各 hub 的批判性综合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边界约定</strong>：本 hub 只在&quot;如何评判&quot;层面展开；凡涉及思想内容（诘问法怎么运作、自知无知是什么），一律链接到 hub 3；凡涉及生平细节（审判经过、赴死场景），一律链接到 hub 1；凡涉及影响（转向、谱系），一律链接到 hub 5。不在此重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐阅读路径\">推荐阅读路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1 历史的苏格拉底&lt;br/&gt;史料批判框架] --&gt; B[2 史料的张力&lt;br/&gt;具体冲突]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 他有罪吗&lt;br/&gt;命运之争]&#10;    C --&gt; D[4 牛虻还是精英主义者&lt;br/&gt;政治之争]&#10;    D --&gt; E[5 西方哲学之父&lt;br/&gt;地位评价]&#10;    E --&gt; F[6 全面的评判&lt;br/&gt;辩证综合]\">flowchart LR\n    A[1 历史的苏格拉底&lt;br/&gt;史料批判框架] --&gt; B[2 史料的张力&lt;br/&gt;具体冲突]\n    B --&gt; C[3 他有罪吗&lt;br/&gt;命运之争]\n    C --&gt; D[4 牛虻还是精英主义者&lt;br/&gt;政治之争]\n    D --&gt; E[5 西方哲学之父&lt;br/&gt;地位评价]\n    E --&gt; F[6 全面的评判&lt;br/&gt;辩证综合]</pre><p>先建立史料批判的工具（1-2），再用它分析两大具体争议（3-4），然后评价其历史地位（5），最后收束为辩证的全面评判（6）。第六篇是全 hub 的综合，建议最后读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置与延伸\">前置与延伸</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>（尤其<a href=\"../life-and-times/trial-and-death/the-trial\">受审</a>）与 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>，本 hub 的评判建立在对这些史实与史料的认识之上。</li>\n<li><strong>关键提醒</strong>：本 hub 大量内容触及学术争议（苏格拉底问题、反民主指控），其结论多为&quot;有依据的判断&quot;而非&quot;定论&quot;；阅读时请关注每篇标注的<strong>史料强度与来源</strong>，区分共识与一家之言。</li>\n<li><strong>自然延伸</strong>：读完本 hub 想深入其思想，转 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>；想了解其身后影响与殉道形象的塑造，转 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-socratic-problem","title":"The Socratic Problem","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-historical-socrates","title":"历史的苏格拉底","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem/the-historical-socrates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sources-in-tension","title":"史料的张力","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem/sources-in-tension"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"was-he-guilty","title":"他有罪吗","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/was-he-guilty"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gadfly-or-elitist","title":"牛虻还是精英主义者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/gadfly-or-elitist"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-western-philosophy","title":"西方哲学之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-father-of-western-philosophy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment"}]}]}